WEBVTT

00:01.668 --> 00:04.237
I'm Nina, 12 years old.

00:04.237 --> 00:07.206
I was just an ordinary
junior high school student, but...

00:08.108 --> 00:11.344
Since the day I accidentally swallowed
a ball called the Crystal Pearl,

00:11.344 --> 00:14.514
my life has changed pretty drastically.

00:14.514 --> 00:17.650
And the ball happened to be something
that's used for the sorcery test.

00:17.650 --> 00:22.322
The team of the two examinees,
which happens to possess that ball

00:22.322 --> 00:25.189
when the test ends, will pass the test
and become professional sorcerers!

00:27.127 --> 00:29.295
Does that mean I'm going to be
chased down by the examinees?

00:29.295 --> 00:32.399
- Don't cry!
- I guess you have no choice
but to prepare yourself, Zero.

00:32.399 --> 00:33.266
Huh?

00:33.266 --> 00:35.335
There is only one way to do this.

00:35.335 --> 00:37.804
You will have to protect her
with everything you've got

00:37.804 --> 00:39.205
until the day that the test ends.

00:39.205 --> 00:40.707
Until the day the medicine is completed

00:40.707 --> 00:44.277
and you're able to remove
the Crystal Pearl from her body...

00:44.277 --> 00:46.379
We will protect her with our own hands!

00:46.379 --> 00:47.380
You mean her?

00:47.380 --> 00:51.618
Me? These guys are going to protect me?

00:51.618 --> 00:54.287
Just like the princes
who bravely face the enemies

00:54.287 --> 00:56.322
no matter how ferocious they are

00:56.322 --> 00:58.291
and fight them for the people
that they love and their own dreams...

00:58.291 --> 01:01.061
These two are going to protect me!

01:01.061 --> 01:13.606
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.606 --> 01:19.879
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.879 --> 01:26.152
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.152 --> 01:32.392
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.392 --> 01:38.665
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.665 --> 01:44.904
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:44.904 --> 01:51.277
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.277 --> 01:57.517
They say there is only one true love

01:57.517 --> 02:03.756
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.756 --> 02:10.096
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.096 --> 02:16.369
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.369 --> 02:22.609
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.609 --> 02:27.569
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:37.023 --> 02:42.729
A little birdie flies away...

02:42.729 --> 02:54.140
A bad, bad birdie,
hurry up and go home...

02:54.140 --> 02:59.679
Zip through the wind with
your wings and go inside the cage.

02:59.679 --> 03:05.418
A little birdie flies away...

03:05.418 --> 03:11.024
Why, why did you fly away?

03:11.024 --> 03:16.629
If you don't listen
to what you are told...

03:16.629 --> 03:22.795
Your wings will be chopped off
and you will be locked inside the cage.

03:24.604 --> 03:27.198
That girl creeps me out.

03:30.877 --> 03:32.645
They said she's cursed.

03:32.645 --> 03:34.747
Yeew, that's creepy!

03:34.747 --> 03:36.883
You jinx!

03:36.883 --> 03:38.851
- You jinx!
- Get out of here!

03:38.851 --> 03:43.756
- Stay away from me!
- You jinx... You jinx...

03:43.756 --> 03:46.259
- You jinx...
- You jinx...

03:46.259 --> 03:48.784
- You jinx...
- You jinx...
- You jinx...

03:50.697 --> 03:56.169
Why, why did you fly away?

03:56.169 --> 04:01.874
If you don't listen
to what you are told...

04:01.874 --> 04:08.040
Your wings will be chopped off
and you will be locked inside the cage.

04:14.254 --> 04:16.889
The cakes in the human world
aren't bad at all either!

04:16.889 --> 04:18.356
This is the best!

04:19.259 --> 04:20.460
This is so strange...

04:20.460 --> 04:25.329
Now I can't even imagine a life
without Ichii, Zero and Zura...

04:26.699 --> 04:28.268
What's the matter, Nina-chan?

04:28.268 --> 04:29.502
Huh?

04:29.502 --> 04:32.872
Oh, it's nothing!

04:32.872 --> 04:34.965
Zura! Look out zura!

04:41.381 --> 04:42.548
Don't worry!

04:42.548 --> 04:44.517
We will protect Nina-chan!

04:44.517 --> 04:46.786
Nina, eat while you can!

04:46.786 --> 04:48.955
I'm so hungry!

04:48.955 --> 04:51.924
I want to eat something!

04:51.924 --> 04:53.026
Eh...

04:53.026 --> 04:56.393
I'm thirsty! Buy me a drink!

04:57.163 --> 04:59.098
I want to eat some ice cream!

04:59.098 --> 05:00.633
I want to eat fruits!

05:00.633 --> 05:02.702
I want...

05:02.702 --> 05:05.899
Now I'm exhausted!

05:07.707 --> 05:11.507
Sheesh... What do I do with you?

05:12.712 --> 05:14.577
Yay, Fo-chan!

05:20.553 --> 05:22.355
What was that about...

05:22.355 --> 05:23.322
I know...

05:30.330 --> 05:32.332
Don't come! Don't come!
Don't come! Don't come!

05:32.332 --> 05:34.334
Yay! Let's play, Fo-chan!

05:34.334 --> 05:38.738
I told you I don't want to wrestle
or play doctor with you any more!

05:38.738 --> 05:40.807
But today is different!

05:40.807 --> 05:41.507
Huh?

05:41.507 --> 05:43.236
Today...

05:44.610 --> 05:46.908
Today is this!

05:48.715 --> 05:51.918
Let's play princesses, Fo-chan!

05:51.918 --> 05:55.922
Wh-What the heck is this?

05:55.922 --> 05:58.618
You look so cute, Fo-chan!

06:02.762 --> 06:04.364
Don't laugh!

06:04.364 --> 06:06.065
But!

06:06.065 --> 06:07.867
Looks great on you zura!

06:07.867 --> 06:10.103
I think he's girlier than girls!

06:10.103 --> 06:12.196
You look adorable, Forte!

06:16.609 --> 06:18.444
Hey, Forte, wait up!

06:18.444 --> 06:20.844
San, you idiot!

06:23.049 --> 06:25.785
Tagano's tart!

06:25.785 --> 06:28.015
Bujiya's cream puffs!

06:29.055 --> 06:31.387
Pastela's pudding!

06:32.392 --> 06:34.894
Gozy Goner's strawberry shortcake!

06:34.894 --> 06:35.895
- Eh...
- Eh...
- Eh...

06:35.895 --> 06:38.064
Forte is being really patient
with her zura...

06:38.064 --> 06:41.267
I wonder if San has
some dirt on him or something.

06:41.267 --> 06:46.005
But you know they've always
been like that, haven't they?

06:46.005 --> 06:51.544
I wonder why Fo-chan
is that sweet to San-chan...

06:51.544 --> 06:53.444
Why...

06:54.480 --> 06:55.882
Hey, Fo-chan!

06:55.882 --> 06:59.419
No! We are not going to
buy anything else today!

06:59.419 --> 07:05.992
But there's one more thing I want.
And that is my favorite, too!

07:05.992 --> 07:07.193
What is that?

07:07.193 --> 07:12.398
What could you possibly like more than
Tagano's tarts or Bujiya's cream puffs?

07:12.398 --> 07:14.300
Your homemade cookies, Fo-chan!

07:14.300 --> 07:15.301
What?

07:15.301 --> 07:18.070
They're my favorite out of all the others!

07:18.070 --> 07:19.038
But...

07:19.038 --> 07:22.074
Make them! I want to eat
Fo-chan's cookies!

07:22.074 --> 07:23.476
Okay?

07:23.476 --> 07:25.137
What...

07:26.913 --> 07:28.681
Cripes!

07:28.681 --> 07:32.242
What made San want to eat cookies
that are baked by me anyway?

07:37.723 --> 07:39.725
It's ready, San!

07:39.725 --> 07:42.421
San? Huh?

07:52.638 --> 07:55.575
"I'll be back before
the time for afternoon tea."

07:55.575 --> 07:58.711
What is this? After I made
all the cookies for her!

07:58.711 --> 07:59.939
Hmm?

08:05.051 --> 08:10.990
That's right, today is San's...

08:10.990 --> 08:16.121
That's what it is...
It's been 7 years since then...

08:21.534 --> 08:23.870
Well, well, well!

08:23.870 --> 08:26.339
It looks great on you, Forte!

08:26.339 --> 08:29.308
Now I would not be ashamed
to send you to any places!

08:29.308 --> 08:33.212
A tea party will be held at
your big grandfather's mansion today.

08:33.212 --> 08:35.348
You'd better dress up
very nicely for it!

08:35.348 --> 08:36.682
"Big grandfather"?

08:36.682 --> 08:39.252
That's right, he is your grandfather.

08:39.252 --> 08:41.988
He's a very powerful man
in the magic world.

08:41.988 --> 08:46.152
I see... My grandfather is...

08:59.138 --> 09:01.374
You're so cute. How old are you?

09:01.374 --> 09:03.543
I'm 7 years old.

09:03.543 --> 09:05.845
What kind of magic do you use?

09:05.845 --> 09:09.248
It's Hypnosis Magic. My mother
has been teaching me that.

09:09.248 --> 09:11.375
Wow, Hypnosis Magic!

09:42.848 --> 09:46.716
That was... That was...

09:51.157 --> 09:54.251
That was how San and I met.

10:14.280 --> 10:17.783
Oh, hey you! Wait a minute!

10:17.783 --> 10:18.985
Forte!

10:18.985 --> 10:20.786
Forte, are you all right?

10:20.786 --> 10:23.222
Mom, I'm okay.

10:23.222 --> 10:26.225
But more importantly,
who was that girl?

10:26.225 --> 10:29.362
That is Lady Salia's daughter, San.

10:29.362 --> 10:31.097
So she is...

10:31.097 --> 10:32.798
Then that means she's your cousin, Fo.

10:32.798 --> 10:33.966
My cousin?

10:33.966 --> 10:36.736
I wonder why she attacked Forte...

10:36.736 --> 10:39.872
That was her usual mischief.
It's just the way she is.

10:39.872 --> 10:43.776
She has possessed extraordinary
magical powers every since she was a baby.

10:43.776 --> 10:45.144
Isn't that scary?

10:45.144 --> 10:47.079
You never know what she'll do.

10:47.079 --> 10:50.249
She must've been the reason why
Lady Salia has fallen ill, too.

10:50.249 --> 10:51.851
She must be cursed.

10:51.851 --> 10:54.353
Oh my... Do not associate with her, Fo.

10:54.353 --> 10:55.588
What?

10:55.588 --> 10:58.457
I mean, have you seen the lady?

10:58.457 --> 11:01.494
Just like the rumor said,
she's a ferocious child.

11:01.494 --> 11:04.588
So freaky! She has to be cursed.

11:05.865 --> 11:08.129
A cursed child...

11:09.168 --> 11:15.174
Bad things happen because of that girl?
Is that why everyone hates her?

11:15.174 --> 11:18.811
A cursed child... Is that true?

11:18.811 --> 11:23.077
Is that why she had
such sad-looking eyes?

11:30.423 --> 11:32.687
That's why she...

11:35.461 --> 11:38.430
Because she's always alone...

11:39.432 --> 11:40.831
Always...

11:46.038 --> 11:48.641
How disturbing! I've heard
that she tried to place a curse

11:48.641 --> 11:50.509
on the little boy Forte this time!

11:50.509 --> 11:51.510
That's scary!

11:51.510 --> 11:53.410
It seems like her magical power
has gotten even more powerful-

11:58.884 --> 12:00.820
Did you see that? How scary!

12:00.820 --> 12:02.822
The girl is weird.

12:02.822 --> 12:04.881
It's best to stay away from her.

12:06.992 --> 12:09.795
Now Forte, try again!

12:09.795 --> 12:11.422
Yes, Mom.

12:22.308 --> 12:25.038
Way to go, Fo! Keep it up!

12:31.751 --> 12:33.252
It is frightening.

12:33.252 --> 12:36.789
Nothing but ominous things
keep on happening. That's just spooky.

12:36.789 --> 12:39.592
Fo, do not associate
with a kid like that.

12:39.592 --> 12:43.028
Do not... Do not... Do not...

12:43.028 --> 12:44.689
Fo! Fo!

12:58.844 --> 13:00.613
Fo, what's the matter?

13:00.613 --> 13:03.912
I'm sorry Mom, but I'll be
right back, so forgive me!

13:04.850 --> 13:05.818
Fo!

13:05.818 --> 13:07.353
Somehow I can't get it out of my mind...

13:07.353 --> 13:11.490
About the girl... About her eyes...
About her smile...

13:11.490 --> 13:16.762
I might not be able to do anything for her,
but I want to find her!

13:16.762 --> 13:20.357
I want to see her! Right now!

13:21.867 --> 13:27.439
A little birdie flies away...

13:27.439 --> 13:38.717
A bad, bad birdie,
hurry up and go home...

13:38.717 --> 13:44.456
Zip through the wind with
your wings and go inside the cage.

13:44.456 --> 13:50.062
A little birdie flies away...

13:50.062 --> 13:55.701
Why, why did you fly away?

13:55.701 --> 14:01.340
If you don't listen
to what you are told...

14:01.340 --> 14:07.279
Your wings will be chopped off
and you will be locked inside the cage.

14:11.851 --> 14:12.985
Who is it?

14:12.985 --> 14:17.888
I'm sorry, but I heard the song,
so I figured it was coming from here.

14:19.291 --> 14:23.929
I was looking for you.
Because I wanted to be your friend.

14:23.929 --> 14:25.297
"Friend"?

14:25.297 --> 14:26.398
Yeah!

14:26.398 --> 14:28.200
Let's play together!

14:28.200 --> 14:32.271
What? You mean,
you're going to play with me?

14:32.271 --> 14:33.405
Yes.

14:33.405 --> 14:36.542
Oh... Who are you?

14:36.542 --> 14:39.545
My name is Forte! Call me "Fo"!

14:39.545 --> 14:43.249
"Fo"? Then you're "Fo-chan"!

14:43.249 --> 14:45.317
Nice to meet you!

14:45.317 --> 14:46.752
Yeah!

14:46.752 --> 14:52.122
Now that I think about it
I think I decided it right then...

14:53.125 --> 14:56.395
That she is my partner...

14:56.395 --> 14:58.931
This girl is...

14:58.931 --> 15:00.592
This girl is...

15:01.734 --> 15:04.336
No! I don't want to! I don't want to!

15:04.336 --> 15:06.305
Hurry! Hurry!

15:06.305 --> 15:09.909
I'm hungry! I want to eat something!

15:09.909 --> 15:12.978
I'm thirsty!
Let's go get something to drink!

15:12.978 --> 15:14.613
I want to eat ice cream, too!

15:14.613 --> 15:16.808
I want some fruits!

15:18.150 --> 15:21.517
I'm exhausted!

15:22.187 --> 15:25.122
Geez, I guess I have to do this...

15:26.125 --> 15:27.426
Here.

15:27.426 --> 15:30.259
Yaay! Thank you, Fo-chan!

15:35.935 --> 15:38.604
Don't come! Don't come!
Don't come! Don't come!

15:38.604 --> 15:41.473
- Fo-chan, let's wrestle!
- No!

15:41.473 --> 15:42.808
- Let's play doctor!
- No!

15:42.808 --> 15:44.143
- Then play house!
- No!

15:44.143 --> 15:46.008
Okay let's do something different today!

15:48.814 --> 15:53.217
Today is an exception!
Let's play princesses!

15:54.753 --> 15:56.989
What the heck is this?

15:56.989 --> 16:00.823
You're so adorable, Fo-chan!
We look the same!

16:02.294 --> 16:04.524
Hey, Fo-chan, wait up!

16:09.969 --> 16:11.804
That idiot San!

16:11.804 --> 16:12.998
Fo-chan!

16:15.975 --> 16:17.442
Who is it?

16:23.282 --> 16:25.751
Wow, she's so beautiful...

16:25.751 --> 16:27.446
Can I help you with something?

16:29.021 --> 16:33.092
Um, I just got lost and- I'm sorry!

16:33.092 --> 16:34.827
Fo-chan where are you?

16:34.827 --> 16:36.228
Huh? That's San!

16:36.228 --> 16:40.199
I'm over here! I came inside a
wrong room by accident! I'm in here!

16:40.199 --> 16:42.234
Hey Fo-chan, I found you!

16:42.234 --> 16:43.469
San!

16:43.469 --> 16:44.870
Oh, that's Mama!

16:44.870 --> 16:46.739
It's Mama! Mama!

16:46.739 --> 16:48.774
What? "Mama"?

16:48.774 --> 16:52.978
You mean this beautiful person, who could
look like her older sister, is San's...

16:52.978 --> 16:55.581
Mama! Mama!

16:55.581 --> 16:57.071
San-chan...

17:01.587 --> 17:06.425
Wow, I didn't know San could
make an expression like that...

17:06.425 --> 17:09.995
An expression that's so...

17:09.995 --> 17:11.826
So great...

17:13.365 --> 17:15.026
What do you think
you're doing there?

17:16.502 --> 17:17.669
Father!

17:17.669 --> 17:21.073
San, I told you not to
come in Salia's room, didn't I?

17:21.073 --> 17:22.641
Get out of here now!

17:22.641 --> 17:24.410
Wait! Just a little longer!

17:24.410 --> 17:27.279
Father, please let San
stay here just a little longer!

17:27.279 --> 17:28.280
No!

17:28.280 --> 17:32.080
Please! let me talk to her...
Let me talk to San just a little longer!

17:36.055 --> 17:38.490
Goodness gracious! You can't
be too careful around you!

17:38.490 --> 17:41.794
How dare you sneak in there
while no one was watching!

17:41.794 --> 17:43.921
Looks like I'd better put
a lock on the door tomorrow!

17:44.897 --> 17:47.066
Don't you ever go in there again, San!

17:47.066 --> 17:50.202
When you go near her,
Salia's condition gets worse,

17:50.202 --> 17:52.404
you cursed child!

17:52.404 --> 17:56.340
Wait a minute! There's no excuse
for you to talk to her that way!

17:58.577 --> 18:01.013
It's okay, Fo-chan.

18:01.013 --> 18:04.917
It's my fault for doing
what I was told not to...

18:04.917 --> 18:06.111
What...

18:07.486 --> 18:13.058
N-No way! That is our grandfather?
He seemed very unpleasant!

18:13.058 --> 18:15.394
Isn't he someone with authority?

18:15.394 --> 18:17.896
Grandfather hates me.

18:17.896 --> 18:19.164
Why?

18:19.164 --> 18:21.700
Because I'm responsible
for my mom's illness.

18:21.700 --> 18:22.801
What?

18:22.801 --> 18:25.771
I'm the cursed child.

18:25.771 --> 18:29.730
So they said my mom will die
if I stay close to her.

18:31.176 --> 18:32.302
Eh?

18:33.479 --> 18:36.615
That doesn't make sense.

18:36.615 --> 18:38.584
But you know...

18:38.584 --> 18:41.086
I've been using a charm.

18:41.086 --> 18:43.355
A charm?

18:43.355 --> 18:47.726
My mother told me that good things
would happen if I were always smiling.

18:47.726 --> 18:52.764
I think my mother's illness will
be cured if I keep on smiling,

18:52.764 --> 18:55.062
so I'm always trying to smile!

18:57.870 --> 18:59.671
I don't know why,

18:59.671 --> 19:03.342
but my mother's condition won't
get better even if I'm always smiling...

19:03.342 --> 19:05.444
I try very hard to
keep on smiling everyday,

19:05.444 --> 19:07.309
but it's not fun at all...

19:08.547 --> 19:14.315
I wonder why even though
I'm always smiling... I wonder why...

19:16.889 --> 19:19.892
San, that's not true.

19:19.892 --> 19:22.828
No matter how much you smile your
mother's illness will not get better.

19:22.828 --> 19:26.165
Even smiles are meaningless
unless you're having fun!

19:26.165 --> 19:30.702
I wanted to tell her that,
but I couldn't find any other words

19:30.702 --> 19:34.006
that wouldn't hurt her,
so I couldn't say anything.

19:34.006 --> 19:38.102
All I could do was to hold her hand...

19:39.444 --> 19:41.713
I could do nothing
but to take her hand

19:41.713 --> 19:46.878
and stay by her side
by sitting next to her...

19:47.886 --> 19:52.524
Staying by her side
for a long, long time...

19:52.524 --> 19:55.687
Long, long time...

19:58.931 --> 20:00.899
It was certainly sudden...

20:00.899 --> 20:02.234
I feel sorry for her.

20:02.234 --> 20:04.803
I still can't believe it.

20:04.803 --> 20:07.738
I can't believe that Salia
had to die so soon...

20:11.577 --> 20:14.413
I wonder if what they say
is true after all...

20:14.413 --> 20:17.940
Did this happen because
that girl is cursed?

20:21.486 --> 20:23.355
Hey, San!

20:23.355 --> 20:24.957
Fo-chan!

20:24.957 --> 20:25.991
Are you okay?

20:25.991 --> 20:27.226
About what?

20:27.226 --> 20:28.594
"About what"?

20:28.594 --> 20:29.628
Unbelievable...

20:29.628 --> 20:30.996
Did you hear that?

20:30.996 --> 20:34.399
Her mother just died,
but she can't even shed a single tear!

20:34.399 --> 20:36.001
Does she even have a thing called heart?

20:36.001 --> 20:40.472
Stop talking nonsense! San is
a normal girl! She is not cursed!

20:40.472 --> 20:42.774
So don't say random stuff, you old hag!

20:42.774 --> 20:43.798
Old?

20:45.577 --> 20:46.979
Let's go, San!

20:46.979 --> 20:49.277
Oh, Fo-chan! Fo-chan!

20:50.816 --> 20:54.119
What's the matter, Fo-chan?
You're hurting my hand!

20:54.119 --> 20:56.455
Fo-chan!

20:56.455 --> 20:58.286
Fo-chan...

20:59.691 --> 21:00.926
San...

21:00.926 --> 21:02.060
It's okay.

21:02.060 --> 21:03.161
Huh?

21:03.161 --> 21:07.633
It's okay to cry when you want to cry!

21:07.633 --> 21:08.767
What...

21:08.767 --> 21:11.536
You don't have to hold back
if you want to cry!

21:11.536 --> 21:14.403
You should smile only when you have fun!

21:18.977 --> 21:21.013
San, you have me.

21:21.013 --> 21:25.684
I might not be able to do anything,
but I promise I'll stay by your side!

21:25.684 --> 21:29.821
I'll always stay closest to your heart!

21:29.821 --> 21:33.025
So it's okay to cry when you're with me.

21:33.025 --> 21:39.865
I'll always watch over you!
I'll always see your smile in you!

21:39.865 --> 21:40.832
San!

21:51.310 --> 21:53.312
Mama! Mama!

21:53.312 --> 21:54.313
Don't...

21:54.313 --> 21:56.848
- Don't leave me all alone!
- You have me.

21:56.848 --> 22:00.652
- Mama! Mama! Mama...
- Your mother may be gone, but you're not alone, San!

22:00.652 --> 22:03.088
You'll always be with me.

22:03.088 --> 22:05.757
I'll stay closest to your heart.

22:05.757 --> 22:10.362
- Don't leave me all alone!
- Always... Always...

22:10.362 --> 22:13.899
Mama! No! Mama!

22:13.899 --> 22:16.663
Mama!!

22:21.773 --> 22:26.733
That was the first and the
last time I've ever seen San cry.

22:28.180 --> 22:31.383
...I've ever seen San cry...

22:31.383 --> 22:37.049
That's right. Today is July 17th.
The anniversary of San's mother's death.

22:38.390 --> 22:40.659
These are the flowers of the human world.

22:40.659 --> 22:44.696
Although they die faster
than the ones from the magic world.

22:44.696 --> 22:46.565
- How pretty...
- Yeah.

22:46.565 --> 22:48.533
Even if they die fast

22:48.533 --> 22:52.037
the fact that they were ever here
will remain in our hearts for a long time.

22:52.037 --> 22:53.705
You're right.

22:53.705 --> 22:54.973
And I will not change, either.

22:54.973 --> 22:55.871
What?

22:56.808 --> 22:59.538
The things that I said to you
on that day will not change, either.

23:02.080 --> 23:03.181
Should we go home now?

23:03.181 --> 23:06.251
The cookies that I baked turned out
even better than usual today.

23:06.251 --> 23:07.650
They taste great.

23:09.154 --> 23:10.655
San...

23:10.655 --> 23:13.258
The feelings that
I have will not change.

23:13.258 --> 23:15.692
I will always be by your side.

23:16.762 --> 23:20.065
Always... I'll stay closest to you.

23:20.065 --> 23:25.470
Fo-chan, I want to eat some
chiffon cake and custard pudding, too!

23:25.470 --> 23:26.405
What?

23:26.405 --> 23:27.606
And I want...

23:27.606 --> 23:29.641
Oh, if that's the case we can
pick them up by the train station.

23:29.641 --> 23:32.110
No! I want you to make it!

23:32.110 --> 23:36.114
- San, I promise I'll be there...
- You want me to make it? But making
them now will take all day!

23:36.114 --> 23:39.379
- I'll be right there
closest to your heart...
- But I still want to eat them!

23:44.356 --> 23:47.292
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.292 --> 23:50.228
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.228 --> 23:53.197
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:01.940 --> 24:07.712
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.712 --> 24:13.585
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.585 --> 24:19.424
No matter which direction I look,
his eyes are crystals.

24:19.424 --> 24:25.297
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.297 --> 24:31.136
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.136 --> 24:39.411
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.411 --> 24:45.350
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.350 --> 24:51.656
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.656 --> 24:57.496
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.496 --> 25:03.335
the shape of my heart will
change just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.335 --> 25:08.932
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:12.010 --> 25:13.578
My name is Will!

25:13.578 --> 25:16.414
I'm an inspector sent by
the sorcery test headquarters!

25:16.414 --> 25:17.382
- "Inspector"?
- "Inspector"?
- "Inspector"?

25:17.382 --> 25:19.751
Starting now I will conduct
the mid-term test!

25:19.751 --> 25:20.886
- Mid-term test?
- Mid-term test?
- Mid-term test?

25:20.886 --> 25:23.616
If you fail to pass this test you will
not be eligible to take the main test!

25:24.623 --> 25:29.027
You must take her back from me by sunset!
That is the objective of the mid-term test!

25:29.027 --> 25:30.462
- Wait!
- Wait!
- Wait!

25:30.462 --> 25:34.165
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop,
"The Mid-Term Test is a Disaster!"

25:34.165 --> 25:37.035
Can you rescue her?

25:37.035 --> 25:39.401
Will, you're getting carried away
a little too much!
